{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARRIVING AT EARTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Starlab</strong> you are a scientist who has journeyed to the long forgotten ruins of humanity's first star. Here you build compute across the solar system to continue your research into the end of the Universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.poster.avif?t=1766254274\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.webm?t=1766254274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/2bb1a1121d32fb4d06954933e6b4452b.mp4?t=1766254274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2D SOLAR SYSTEM WITH REAL GRAVITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every planet pulls toward its own center. Walk around entire moons. Launch rockets that orbit, slingshot, and crash. The solar system is seamless\u2014<strong>no loading screens</strong> between Earth and the outer reaches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTOMATE EVERYTHING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a pickaxe. End with automated extractors feeding refineries feeding factories feeding space cannons launching payloads between worlds without you. Your job is to build the system, then let it run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIE, CLONE, REPEAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien swarms and rogue machines will hunt you. You'll run out of oxygen. Your rocket will miss its landing. Clone back at your <strong>Starlab</strong> and try again\u2014<strong>your infrastructure survives</strong> even when you don't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.poster.avif?t=1766254274\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.webm?t=1766254274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.mp4?t=1766254274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot</strong> rockets, trucks, and jetpacks with real fuel and momentum management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate</strong> extraction, refining, and manufacturing across multiple planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> electrical grids with solar panels, power plants, and batteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research</strong> weapons, vehicles, and survival gear through a tech tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your scientist with gear and cosmetic options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm</strong>, <strong>Build</strong>, and <strong>Craft</strong> to establish permanent footholds    </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1869770?t=1766254274","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/4d06a99e99e9c3c129453c7e84a475df46513f79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766254274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/afde67f11948b88c406714fc8f7c355dec43e1cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766254274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/afde67f11948b88c406714fc8f7c355dec43e1cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766254274","