lab</strong> and try again\u2014<strong>your infrastructure survives</strong> even when you don't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.poster.avif?t=1766254274\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.webm?t=1766254274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/extras/321123e543e07c7e649cda2e280eb48c.mp4?t=1766254274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot</strong> rockets, trucks, and jetpacks with real fuel and momentum management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate</strong> extraction, refining, and manufacturing across multiple planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage</strong> electrical grids with solar panels, power plants, and batteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research</strong> weapons, vehicles, and survival gear through a tech tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize</strong> your scientist with gear and cosmetic options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm</strong>, <strong>Build</strong>, and <strong>Craft</strong> to establish permanent footholds    </p></li></ul>","developers":["Next Star Over"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1869770/cd3f722214a50136ce9f3193775e960d960e1a51/header.jpg?t=1766254274","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</st